    "title": "Mid-Level Investment Banker at ICICI Lombard International Enterprises",
    "description": "ICICI Lombard International Enterprises is actively seeking a talented and motivated Investment Banker to join our dynamic team in Vadodara. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout ICICI Lombard International Enterprises:\nICICI Lombard International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Implement and maintain internal controls and audit procedures\n• Liaise with banks, regulators, and financial institutions\n• Monitor financial performance against targets and provide variance analysis\n• Prepare and analyze financial statements, reports, and budgets\n• Maintain general ledger and ensure accurate bookkeeping\n• Ensure compliance with tax regulations and statutory requirements\n• Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable functions\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBBS / MD / MS from recognized medical college\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Ind AS\n• Proficiency in Tally\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in VBA\n• Proficiency in Budgeting\n• Proficiency in IFRS\n• Proficiency in Forecasting\n• Proficiency in Income Tax\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Flexible working hours\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vadodara, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with ICICI Lombard International Enterprises!",
